LOOP_CTL_GET_FREE allocates the kernel loop object and returns N.
It does not create /dev/loopN. Host devtmpfs does; a container /dev does not.
Create the node before opening it. EEXIST means udev or a prior mknod won.

--- a/core/mount/losetup_linux.go
+++ b/core/mount/losetup_linux.go
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@
